<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2983" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκατάλληλ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not fitting together,
				incongruous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.42.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				397b31
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arr.
				<u>Epict.</u>
				2.11.8
			</span></i>; <i>unsuitable</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				62
			</span></i>; <i>inconsequent</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1676.8
			</span></i>:—esp. Gramm., <i>ungrammatical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνθύμημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Dem.</u>
					27
				</span></i>
			; <i>lacking in concord</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Synt.</u>
				30.5
			</span></i>, al. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>
			<i>ungrammatically</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος -ως συντεταγμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.
				</span></i>
			 Bab.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				3.214
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως κείμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Synt.</u>
					89.18
				</span></i>
			; generally, <i>incongruously</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.40
			</span></i>:—also in Law, <i>not in conformity with
				regulations</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηματίζειν,
			πρᾶξαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGnom.</u>
				117
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				106
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
